# Second Brain Template Vault

This workspace is an **Obsidian vault** (PARA + Zettelkasten), not an app repo. See root `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, and `README.en.md`.

## Structure

- `0-Inbox` staging → weekly via `7-Templates/WeeklyInboxRitual.md`
- `1-Projects` finishable｜`2-Areas` ongoing｜`3-Resources` reference
- `5-Zettelkasten` one idea each｜`6-DailyNotes/YYYY-MM-DD.md`
- Unsure → `0-Inbox` or ask

## Markdown

- Wikilink `[[Note]]`; external URLs use normal Markdown links
- Before editing `.md`: if `.cursor/skills/obsidian-markdown/SKILL.md` exists, read it and follow OFM
- Match the user’s language (Traditional Chinese ↔ Chinese notes; English ↔ English notes)

## Git

- Commit/push only when the user **explicitly asks**
- Do not change git config; do not force-push
- Do not commit `.obsidian/workspace.json` or plugin `data.json` (see `.gitignore`)

## Change policy

- Minimal diffs; do not delete top-level PARA folders; do not turn this template into a private workflow
- Long-term projects may use Plan + Dashboard + Daily (see README)
